
---
import DocsLayout from '/src/layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import DocsCode from '/src/components/DocsCode.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.SetRemoteScriptAccessPin(PIN: number)`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`llSetRemoteScriptAccessPin(integer PIN);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Allows a prim to have scripts remotely loaded via <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlRemoteLoadScriptPin" target="_blank">llRemoteLoadScriptPin</a> when it is passed the correct pin and the prim is set mod.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>number</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>integer</span></td>
          <td>PIN / <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Parameters/pin" target="_blank">pin</a></td>
          <td>zero disables (ie <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlRemoteLoadScriptPin" target="_blank">llRemoteLoadScriptPin</a> will fail), non-zero enables.</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Categories</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>prim_inventory</li>
        <li>script</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">Sleep</span><span class="tech-val">0.2s</span></div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">Energy</span><span class="tech-val">10</span></div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">LSO ID</span><span class="tech-val">252</span></div>

      <div class="label-stack">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
  <h2>Caveats</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>This function causes the script to sleep for 0.2 seconds.</li>
    <li>A prim has only one pin for remotely loading scripts.
    <ul>
      <li>By changing the pin, a script can deny other scripts the ability to load scripts into the prim.
      <ul>
        <li>This could result in unintentionally breaking a products ability to be updated by an upstream creator.</li>
        <li>This can be used to intentionally stop an upstream creator from updating a product.</li>
        <li>There is no way to find out whether a script pin has been set by another script in the prim. If the prim contains scripts from other developers, the safe approach is to assume a script pin has been set by an upstream creator.</li>
      </ul>
    
      </li>
    </ul>
  
    </li>
  </ul>
